    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732050/extras/3210bf25df132ed4a61a84a030a16d96.avif?t=1751761307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Syncers - Browser. PvP. Warfare.<u></u></i></strong><br></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Syncers is coming to Steam....</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Syncers</i> - A 1-man, low-poly, space brawler from the depths of indie space. No more dopamine-drenched, ad-bloated, battle-pass nightmares. This is <i><strong>BROWSER PVP WARFARE. </strong></i>It's what you've been waiting for, but didn't know existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Syncers </i>is about getting back to the heart of gaming, straight into the action - <i>Within 60 seconds, players are fighting in the Syncers battle arena.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a one man project, and a solo-dev's love letter to old school game design with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No <i>adds\u00a0</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No <i>bloat</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No BS</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just\u00a0pick your server, pick your team, and <strong>FIGHT</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <i>RAW <strong>BROWSER PVP WARFARE. </strong></i>And it's coming for you...<br>  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732050/extras/3210bf25df132ed4a61a84a030a16d96.avif?t=1751761307\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Syncers - Browser. PvP. Warfare.<u></u></i></strong><br></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Syncers is coming to Steam....</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Syncers</i> - A 1-man, low-poly, space brawler from the depths of indie space. No more dopamine-drenched, ad-bloated, battle-pass nightmares. This is <i><strong>BROWSER PVP WARFARE. </strong></i>It's what you've been waiting for, but didn't know existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Syncers </i>is about getting back to the heart of gaming, straight into the action - <i>Within 60 seconds, players are fighting in the Syncers battle arena.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a one man project, and a solo-dev's love letter to old school game design with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No <i>adds\u00a0</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No <i>bloat</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No BS</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just\u00a0pick your server, pick your team, and <strong>FIGHT</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <i>RAW <strong>BROWSER PVP WARFARE. </strong></i>And it's coming for you...<br>  </p>",
